Package: patchFPCA
Type: Package
Title: Functional PCA of Habitat-Patch Distance Profiles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Nathalie Puggaard Elkær A", family = "Ibsen",
           role = "aut", comment = "Author of the supplied analysis scripts"),
    person(given = "Derek", family = "Corcoran",
           email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("cre", "ctb"),
           comment = "Package maintainer; replace placeholder email before publication")
    )
Description: Reproducible preprocessing, balanced functional principal
    component analysis, patch projection, and diagnostic tests for ordered
    nearest-neighbour habitat-patch distance profiles. The default analysis
    reproduces the supplied manuscript scripts by fitting an uncentred,
    unscaled principal component analysis to log-transformed profiles, while
    also supporting conventional column-centred sensitivity analyses.
