Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/derek-corcoran-barrios/patchFPCA
